{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender module api boundary blender module api boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","fileName":"Blender Module API Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Module API Boundary","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Core Source Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Core Source Architecture","Blender Source Module","Blender Intern Directory Convention","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender module api boundary blender module api boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","fileName":"Blender Module API Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Module API Boundary","heading":"Blender Module API Boundary","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Blender modules distinguish externally callable functions from internal helpers through placement and naming. Public functions are declared in interface headers above an `intern` directory and commonly use an uppercase module prefix such as `WM_`, `BKE_`, `BLI_`, or `BLO_`.\n\nLowercase functions with the same abbreviation usually remain implementation details inside the module. This boundary lets callers depend on a stable [[Blender Source Module]] interface while its [[Blender Intern Directory Convention]] hides lower-level branching, static helpers, and data-handling steps.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Core Source Architecture","Blender Source Module","Blender Intern Directory Convention","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender module api boundary blender module api boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Module API Boundary.md","fileName":"Blender Module API Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Module API Boundary","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Core Source Architecture","Blender Source Module","Blender Intern Directory Convention","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}